# WTDRVD.KEY - run as "WTDRV /DROP": the name of the second snapshot is
# one character longer than the driver takes (TD_NAMELEN of
# SRC/WIN/TDRV.H), so the driver refuses the script and ends the run
# itself, failing SCRIPT at that line, though the program drops the
# quit that would end its loop; TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/WTDRVD.SNP.
S START
S NINECHARS
